## Commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make dev` | Dev server |
| `make lint` | Biome lint and format check |
| `make typecheck` | Route typegen + tsc |
| `make test` | Tests (no network) |
| `make coverage` | Tests with coverage |
| `make build` | Production build |
| `make start` | Serve the production build |

